{"id": "ja-final-08", "language": "ja", "text": "バイバイ。またね。", "seconds": 0.42680153201217763, "first_audio_seconds": 0.4239729660039302, "first_sound_seconds": 0.7678479660039301, "duration": 1.825, "chunks": [{"ready": 0.4239729660039302, "duration": 1.825}], "simulated_gap_seconds": 0, "peak": 22658, "frames": 43800}
{"id": "ja-final-09", "language": "ja", "text": "バイバイを英語に訳してください。会話は続けます。", "seconds": 0.9357019109884277, "first_audio_seconds": 0.9318334859854076, "first_sound_seconds": 1.2887918193187409, "duration": 4.175, "chunks": [{"ready": 0.9318334859854076, "duration": 4.175}], "simulated_gap_seconds": 0, "peak": 24322, "frames": 100200}
{"id": "ja-final-10", "language": "ja", "text": "一足す一の答えを教えてください。", "seconds": 0.7251933070074301, "first_audio_seconds": 0.7220924330176786, "first_sound_seconds": 1.0776340996843452, "duration": 3.175, "chunks": [{"ready": 0.7220924330176786, "duration": 3.175}], "simulated_gap_seconds": 0, "peak": 25398, "frames": 76200}
